Impact:
During the incident window, MQTT subscriptions experienced disruptions that prevented data from being delivered in real time. Devices attempting to subscribe or maintain subscriptions may have encountered failures, delays, or missing data.

Resolution:
Our engineering team identified abnormal connection behavior that led to message queue saturation within the MQTT service. To restore functionality, queues were purged, affected MQTT clients were reset, and supporting services were restarted. Service was fully restored by 4:20 AM (UTC-5) on September 26.

Current Status:
The MQTT service is operating normally, and monitoring has been reinforced to ensure stability.</description></item><item><title>MQTT [resolved]</title><link>https://stspg.io/twy2v0ctb8n9</link><guid isPermaLink="false">ubidots:2025-09-24T16:20:30.449Z</guid><pubDate>Wed, 24 Sep 2025 16:20:30 +0000</pubDate><description>This incident has been resolved.</description></item><item><title>HTTP [resolved]</title><link>https://stspg.io/g837k4wxwdct</link><guid isPermaLink="false">ubidots:2025-09-24T16:19:05.203Z</guid><pubDate>Wed, 24 Sep 2025 16:19:05 +0000</pubDate><description>This incident has been resolved.</description></item><item><title>TCP [resolved]</title><link>https://stspg.io/0tzr5krdffx3</link><guid isPermaLink="false">ubidots:2025-09-24T06:18:18.873Z</guid><pubDate>Wed, 24 Sep 2025 06:18:18 +0000</pubDate><description>This incident has been resolved.</description></item><item><title>Issues loading ubidots.com website [resolved]</title><link>https://stspg.io/fgbd9rpfx2p1</link><guid isPermaLink="false">ubidots:2025-08-21T19:23:59.096Z</guid><pubDate>Thu, 21 Aug 2025 19:23:59 +0000</pubDate><description>Webflow has implemented a fix which mean our website (ubidots.com) is working as expected.</description></item><item><title>Generalized platform latency Core and API [resolved]</title><link>https://stspg.io/320jc08v48zm</link><guid isPermaLink="false">ubidots:2025-08-18T17:18:44.257Z</guid><pubDate>Mon, 18 Aug 2025 17:18:44 +0000</pubDate><description>This incident has been resolved.</description></item><item><title>HTML Canvas and Widget plugins not working [resolved]</title><link>https://stspg.io/3fysjrdgr3nv</link><guid isPermaLink="false">ubidots:2025-08-13T14:41:09.227Z</guid><pubDate>Wed, 13 Aug 2025 14:41:09 +0000</pubDate><description>We have replaced old CDN links, serving libraries used in the HTML canvas widget, Widget plugins and Pages, for new one that do not error.</description></item></channel></rss>